{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123242","id":4454559565,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCYMvTQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123242","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123242.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123242.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123242","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123242/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123242/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123242/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4c0eccb6c1a9435b07c029265f9a72c3b42ba6ba","number":123242,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Apple: add tvOS export and compatibility support","user":{"login":"mime29","id":2211828,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTE4Mjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2211828?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mime29","html_url":"https://github.com/mime29","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mime29/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mime29/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mime29/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mime29/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mime29/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mime29/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mime29/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mime29/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mime29/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nThis draft carries the tvOS platform/export work from #118332 plus the additional compatibility fixes we needed to ship and validate a real Godot game on iOS/iPadOS/tvOS.\n\nThe branch adds and updates:\n\n- tvOS platform/export support based on #118332\n- tvOS static library/export-template generation\n- tvOS Compatibility renderer support using OpenGL ES 3\n- runtime fallback from Metal to Compatibility on Apple TV hardware that does not support Godot's Metal renderer requirements\n- tvOS display scale handling so the rendered viewport is not cropped to the lower-left portion of the screen\n- Siri Remote input bridging: swipes map to arrow keys, Select maps to Enter, Menu maps to Escape, Play/Pause maps to Space\n- tvOS export renderer option: Compatibility by default, Metal selectable for newer hardware\n- tvOS-specific `UIRequiredDeviceCapabilities` generation so iPhone/iPad-only A12 flags are not emitted into tvOS archives\n- GLES3 startup/runtime guards used by the tvOS compatibility path\n\n## Validation\n\nValidated against the library/configuration used to ship Trivall on the App Store.\n\nLocal build verification:\n\n```sh\n/Users/mikael/dev/fracta-new/engines/.godot-build-venv/bin/scons platform=tvos target=template_release arch=arm64 vulkan=no metal=yes opengl3=yes -j8\n```\n\nResult: builds `bin/libgodot.tvos.template_release.arm64.a` successfully.\n\n## Relationship to #118332\n\n#118332 is the original upstream draft for tvOS platform support. This branch is a companion/update branch that includes that work plus release-proven compatibility fixes. It is still a draft because the upstream tvOS base work is currently behind `master` and will need conflict resolution before it is review-ready.\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":9548448620,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAACOSHDbA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:visionos","name":"platform:visionos","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/us